工具​ ​用途​ <code>ListSkill</code> ​返回​当前​阶段​专用​技能​和​可用​通用​技能​的​名称​、​描述​、<code>SKILL.md</code> ​与​脚本​路径​ <code>ReadTextFile</code> ​读取​技能​正文​并​登记​阅读​证据​ <code>RunSkillScript</code> ​顺序​执行​已​列出​的​技能​脚本​，​全部​成功​后​登记​使用​ <code>SetSkillUsage</code> ​验证​并​保存​当前​阶段​专用​技能​的​证据​ <p><code>ListSkill</code> ​优先​列出​全部​阶段​技能​，​再​按​ <code>skill.max_skill_list_count</code> ​限制​补充​通用​技能​；​阶段​技能​不会​因该​上限​被​截断​。​技能​标识​是​相对​于​工作​区​技能​根目录​的​路径​，​例如​ <code>unitytest/static-bug-analysis</code>。</p> <p><code>RunSkillScript.commands</code> ​是非​空​数组​，​每项​为​三个​字符串​：<code>[skill_name, script_filename, args]</code>。​脚本​名不含​目录​或​ runner。​假设​自定义​技能​ <code>example/analysis</code> ​已​列出​脚本​ <code>analyze.py</code>，​调用​形式​为​：</p> <pre><code>{
  "commands": [
    ["example/analysis", "analyze.py", "--input 'input.md'"]
  ]
}
</code></pre> <p>​优先​传​嵌套​ JSON ​数组​。​脚本​按​顺序​执行​，​任一​失败​就​停止​；​已​执行​的​文件​修改​不会​自动​回滚​，​整次​调用​失败​也​不会​登记​本次​脚本​使用​。</p>

Tool Purpose <code>ListSkill</code> Returns names, descriptions, <code>SKILL.md</code> paths, and script paths for current stage-specific skills and available general skills <code>ReadTextFile</code> Reads skill content and registers reading evidence <code>RunSkillScript</code> Executes listed skill scripts sequentially; registers usage only if all succeed <code>SetSkillUsage</code> Validates and saves evidence for current stage-specific skills <p><code>ListSkill</code> prioritizes listing all stage skills, then supplements with general skills limited by <code>skill.max_skill_list_count</code>; stage skills are not truncated by this limit. Skill identifiers are paths relative to the workspace skill root directory, e.g., <code>unitytest/static-bug-analysis</code>.</p> <p><code>RunSkillScript.commands</code> is a non-empty array, where each item is a tuple of three strings: <code>[skill_name, script_filename, args]</code>. Script names do not include directories or runners. Assuming a custom skill <code>example/analysis</code> has listed the script <code>analyze.py</code>, the call format is:</p> <pre><code>{
  "commands": [
    ["example/analysis", "analyze.py", "--input 'input.md'"]
  ]
}
</code></pre> <p>Prefer passing nested JSON arrays. Scripts are executed in order; if any fails, execution stops. File modifications already executed are not automatically rolled back, and a failed entire call does not register script usage for that attempt.</p>
